9143803975":{"a":"<p>That Voice in the back of your mind &quot;You know what you need?&quot; is just an alien Madlib repeating in your head. You fill in the blanks and imagine your own reality around the Madlib prompt. It constantly throws incomplete thoughts at you to see how you fill in the blanks. Judges 🫵 <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1981971248314712491\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1981971248314712491\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1981971248314712491</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1982159768853635074\">https://x.com/i/status/1982159768853635074</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982168209143803975</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982168209143803975\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T19:31:42Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982168369395577073":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://x.com/davidlnorris/status/1975225618146177311\">Tweet by @davidlnorris</a> <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1975225618146177311\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/davidlnorris/status/1975225618146177311\">https://x.com/davidlnorris/status/1975225618146177311</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1982168209143803975\">https://x.com/i/status/1982168209143803975</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982168369395577073</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982168369395577073\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T19:32:20Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982181458102894874":{"a":"<p>I&#x27;m sitting here eating lunch on the porch as I often do. One of the birds I fed in the spring just brought me this... Daww. 😭 t.co</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982181458102894874\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982181458102894874</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982181458102894874</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982181458102894874\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T20:24:21Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982193427384058083":{"a":"<p>So I left it there for a bit to see if it was an accident. She kept coming back and checking it. Then I took it and bit off a tiny part. Set the rest aside to give back to them later. She came back, saw it was gone, and brought another piece the same size. Max Sparrow Size. 😂🐦‍⬛… t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1982181458102894874\">https://x.com/i/status/1982181458102894874</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982193427384058083\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982193427384058083</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982193427384058083</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982193427384058083\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T21:11:55Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982194054419923264":{"a":"<p>What&#x27;s more curious is that it&#x27;s not stale. It tastes like fresh baked French bread. Can&#x27;t figure out where they&#x27;re getting it from.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1982193427384058083\">https://x.com/i/status/1982193427384058083</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982194054419923264</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982194054419923264\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T21:14:24Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982202270650396714":{"a":"<p>May the birds provide for everyone who is hungry this season and ever after. Being hungry isn&#x27;t even for the birds. Squawk! 🦅</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1982194054419923264\">https://x.com/i/status/1982194054419923264</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982202270650396714</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982202270650396714\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T21:47:03Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1982229602404651335":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=56P7tKmZjUo\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/56P7tKmZjUo\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=56P7tKmZjUo\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1981783508436570386\">https://x.com/i/status/1981783508436570386</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1982229602404651335</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1982229602404651335\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-25T23:35:39Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}